1232	 * SECURITY: this is NOT an unauthenticated, root-logged-in phpMyAdmin. Adminer
1233	 * shows only a LOGIN form; the customer authenticates with their OWN scoped DB
1234	 * user (created by createHostingDatabase / buildScopedGrantSql — granted on THAT
1235	 * customer's databases only, '<user>'@'localhost'). So even if the randomized URL
1236	 * leaks: (1) the visitor still needs a valid DB username+password, which only the
