1238	 * inside the tenant's own FPM pool on the node, so the connection is localhost;
1239	 * (3) the grants confine that user to its own databases, so there is no lateral
1240	 * path to a neighbour's data. The file is downloaded AS the jailed account user
1241	 * (never root), so it lands owned by the tenant inside their chroot.
