199	 * account's webroot (`/nxtools-<token>/adminer.php`). Lowercase alnum only, so it
200	 * is shell-inert AND a valid nginx-served directory name; length-bounded to keep
201	 * it unguessable without being unwieldy. The real access control is the tenant's
